{"unit_id": "tag:02G1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的一个态射（morphism）。假设<MATH_0002>是光滑（smooth）的。则<MATH_0003>，即<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的微分（differentials）模（module），是有限局部自由（finite locally free）的，且<MATH_0006>对每个<MATH_0007>都成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指态射的源和目标所属的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "指给定的概形之间的映射。"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑", "context": "指对给定态射施加的性质。"}, {"source_term": "differentials", "target_term": "微分", "context": "用于指相对微分模中的微分。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指相对微分所构成的模。"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "描述该微分模局部自由且秩有限。"}], "notes": []}
